  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.03 Cordwood and fuel wood",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.03 “Cordwood and fuel wood” means wood that is cut into specified lengths, or tree length, to be used in woodstoves and wood furnaces for heating purposes or used in the production of maple syrup.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24",
